  "detail_text": "Misawa AB, Japan is in need of Construction Escorts who are U.S. Citizens and hold a TIER 1 Investigation Clearance to monitor local nationals working on upcoming construction projects. This need is expected to begin later in FY 26 and projected to extend through FY 31. Please see attahced docuemnhts for details. Interested vendors should reach out to the below POCs to be added tot eh interested parties list. It is recommended to sumbit any questions and/or suggestions you may have in regard to the attahced documents to the below POCs prior to (20 March 2026) after this posting. The USG will provide an updated posting with responses after 20 March 2026. The USG, anticipates posting a solicitation for this requirement in the coming future.",
